## Better booked with us

Booking through this site rather than through an agent takes ten percent off the room rate, every day of the year, and another ten percent off the Royal Breakfast.

It also gets you into your room earlier and out of it later: check-in from 14:00 rather than 15:00, and checkout at 12:00 rather than 11:00.

Add a bottle of wine, a birthday package or breakfast when you reserve, choose how you would like to pay, and message the team directly before, during and after your stay.
